<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Commande en cours de livraison</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F9FAFB;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #F9FAFB;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0;">
            <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
                <!-- Header -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12A855 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <span style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff;">RECYCLUM</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Body -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <!-- Icon -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 20px;">
                                    <span style="font-size: 56px; line-height: 1;">&#128666;</span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Title -->
                        <h1 style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #1F2937; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Votre commande est en route !</h1>
                        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #6B7280; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">{{ order.deliveryFirstName }}, votre colis est en cours de livraison vers vous.</p>

                        <!-- Order Info -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border: 2px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Commande</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">{{ order.orderNumber }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Date d'expédition</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">{{ order.shippedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Statut actuel</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; text-align: right;">
                                                <span style="display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #7C3AED 100%); color: white; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">En cours de livraison</span>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Delivery Info Box -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05) 100%); border: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 25px; text-align: center;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 18px; color: #1F2937;">&#127968; Livraison prévue</h3>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                                        Notre équipe de livraison vous contactera très prochainement pour convenir d'un créneau de livraison qui vous convient.
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Timeline -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <!-- Step 1 - Done -->
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #E5E7EB;">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="40" valign="top">
                                                <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #16C669; border-radius: 50%; color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 36px; text-align: center;">&#10003;</div>
                                            </td>
                                            <td valign="middle" style="padding-left: 12px;">
                                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2937;">Commande reçue</p>
                                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280;">{{ order.createdAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>

                                    <!-- Step 2 - Done -->
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #E5E7EB;">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="40" valign="top">
                                                <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #16C669; border-radius: 50%; color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 36px; text-align: center;">&#10003;</div>
                                            </td>
                                            <td valign="middle" style="padding-left: 12px;">
                                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2937;">Préparée</p>
                                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280;">Colis vérifié et emballé</p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>

                                    <!-- Step 3 - Current -->
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #E5E7EB;">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="40" valign="top">
                                                <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #8B5CF6; border-radius: 50%; color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 36px; text-align: center;">&#128666;</div>
                                            </td>
                                            <td valign="middle" style="padding-left: 12px;">
                                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #1F2937;">En cours de livraison</p>
                                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6B7280;">En route vers {{ order.deliveryCity }}</p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>

                                    <!-- Step 4 - Pending -->
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td width="40" valign="top">
                                                <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; background: #E5E7EB; border-radius: 50%; color: #9CA3AF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 36px; text-align: center;">&#127968;</div>
                                            </td>
                                            <td valign="middle" style="padding-left: 12px;">
                                                <p style="margin: 0 0 2px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #9CA3AF;">Livrée</p>
                                                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #9CA3AF;">Bientôt chez vous !</p>
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Delivery Address -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border: 2px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1F2937;">&#128205; Adresse de livraison</h3>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.8; color: #4B5563; font-size: 14px;">
                                        <strong>{{ order.deliveryFirstName }} {{ order.deliveryLastName }}</strong><br>
                                        {{ order.deliveryStreet }}<br>
                                        {% if order.deliveryStreetComplement %}{{ order.deliveryStreetComplement }}<br>{% endif %}
                                        {{ order.deliveryPostalCode }} {{ order.deliveryCity }}<br>
                                        &#128222; {{ order.deliveryPhone }}
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Tips Box -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #ECFDF5; border-left: 4px solid #16C669; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <h4 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #065F46; font-size: 15px;">&#128203; Pour une livraison réussie</h4>
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #047857;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Assurez-vous d'être joignable au {{ order.deliveryPhone }}
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #047857;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Préparez un espace pour accueillir votre appareil
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #047857;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Vérifiez l'état du colis à la réception
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        {% if order.deliveryType == 'with_installation' %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #047857;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Notre technicien installera votre appareil sur place
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Footer -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="background: #1F2937; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #ffffff;">Une question sur votre livraison ? <a href="mailto:contact@recyclum.com" style="color: #16C669; text-decoration: none;">Contactez-nous</a></p>
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">&copy; {{ "now"|date('Y') }} Recyclum - Electroménager reconditionné</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
